'''DreamDream''' (Japanese: '''ドリドリ''' ''Doridori'') is the third Japanese ending theme of {{aniseries|XY}}. It debuted as an ending song in [[XY047]], replacing [[Peace Smile!]]. A newly arranged version sung by [[Mayuki Makiguchi]] and arranged by Saku is also used as an ending theme for [[XY113]] and [[XY138]].

==Ending animation: Version 1 (XY047 - XY067)==
===Synopsis===
{{an|Serena}} is seen doing several different performances with {{TP|Serena|Fennekin}} and {{TP|Serena|Pancham}}, each time with different clothes and styles in her performance. At the end of her final performance, she bows her head and smiles and then we see her, Fennekin, and Pancham all asleep, revealing Serena was dreaming about becoming a [[Pokémon Performer]].

